## 11. Known Limitations & Edge Cases

| Scenario | Status | Mitigation |
|----------|--------|-----------|
| Raw NTFS access via `\\.\HarddiskVolumeX` | Not intercepted | Block raw device handles in minifilter (IRP_MJ_CREATE filter) |
| Memory-mapped file zeroed before delete | Content destroyed before capture | Intercept `NtCreateSection` on writable mappings |
| Network filesystem (SMB) files | Minifilter intercepts local SMB client, not remote NTFS | Deploy on file server as well |
| Very large files (>100 GB) | Capture delay blocks calling process | Async copy via work item; immediately reply FLT_PREOP_SUCCESS while copy proceeds in background |
| Vault disk full | New captures fail → delete blocked | Pre-flight free space check; configurable purge policy |
| Driver unload by admin | `FltUnregisterFilter` forcibly unloads | Code-signing + WHCP submission makes removal auditable |
| Altitude conflicts | Another minifilter at 360000 | Choose from FSFilter Activity Monitor range: 320000–329999 or 360000–389999 |

