## Appendix A — Minifilter Altitude Reference

| Altitude Range | Load Order Group | Typical Use |
|---------------|-----------------|-------------|
| 420000–429999 | FSFilter Top | Highest — runs before everything |
| 400000–409999 | FSFilter Copy | Backup agents |
| **360000–389999** | **FSFilter Activity Monitor** | **← DVault lives here** |
| 320000–329999 | FSFilter Undelete | Recycle bin enhancements |
| 260000–269999 | FSFilter Anti-Virus | AV real-time scan |
| 180000–189999 | FSFilter Encryption | Transparent encryption (EFS-like) |
| 0 | NTFS | Bottom — file system itself |

**DVault at 360000 sits ABOVE antivirus (260000), meaning it captures files before AV can quarantine/delete them** — critical for preserving evidence AV would otherwise destroy.

